{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 15 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图神经网络：当边、拓扑和关系本身就是医学信息</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Graph &amp; Mesh Networks</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_134_voxel2mesh-title\">Voxel2Mesh</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Voxel2Mesh 不先分割再 marching cubes，而由 3D 体素特征逐级驱动球形模板的 GCN 形变和细分。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Deforms a sphere template mesh progressively into a target 3D anatomical surface via Graph Convolutions conditioned on 3D CNN voxel features sampled at mesh vertices.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 医学体积与初始球形模板 mesh</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D medical imaging volume (CT/MRI/EM) + initial genus-0 spherical template mesh</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">器官表面的顶点、三角面与可选体素分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Explicit 3D anatomical triangle mesh (vertices V, faces F) and auxiliary voxel segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.03681\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Voxel2Mesh original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/c4ecce21ae0762cdfa72.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D volume</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D volume</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">CT/MRI 体素网格</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging volume (ct/mri/em) + initial genus-0 spherical template mesh and prepares initial tensor representations (3D volume).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"CT/MRI 体素网格\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d medical imaging volume (ct/mri/em) + initial genus-0 spherical template mesh and prepares initial tensor representations (3D volume).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D volume\" data-node-name-en=\"3D volume\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D volume</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CT/MRI 体素网格</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging volume (ct/mri/em) + initial genus-0 spherical template mesh and prepares initial tensor representations (3D volume).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"提取从粗到细的体素特征图\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 3D CNN/U-Net encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"3D CNN/U-Net encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"3D CNN/U-Net encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D CNN/U-Net encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">提取从粗到细的体素特征图</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 3D CNN/U-Net encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"固定拓扑的低分辨率顶点与三角面\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs sphere mesh within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"初始 sphere mesh\" data-node-name-en=\"sphere mesh\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">初始 sphere mesh</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sphere mesh</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">固定拓扑的低分辨率顶点与三角面</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs sphere mesh within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按当前顶点坐标从体素特征图插值局部特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Voxel-to-vertex feature sampling within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Voxel-to-vertex feature sampling\" data-node-name-en=\"Voxel-to-vertex feature sampling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Voxel-to-vertex feature sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按当前顶点坐标从体素特征图插值局部特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Voxel-to-vertex feature sampling within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"结合邻接顶点与采样体素特征预测顶点位移\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Graph convolution deformation within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Graph convolution deformation\" data-node-name-en=\"Graph convolution deformation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Graph convolution deformation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">结合邻接顶点与采样体素特征预测顶点位移</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Graph convolution deformation within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级增加顶点并保留拓扑邻接，精化复杂表面\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Adaptive mesh unpooling within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Adaptive mesh unpooling\" data-node-name-en=\"Adaptive mesh unpooling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Adaptive mesh unpooling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级增加顶点并保留拓扑邻接，精化复杂表面</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Adaptive mesh unpooling within the core voxel guided progressive mesh gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Chamfer/point、edge、Laplacian 与法向等约束形状和网格质量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Surface + topology losses to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Surface + topology losses\" data-node-name-en=\"Surface + topology losses\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Surface + topology losses</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Chamfer/point、edge、Laplacian 与法向等约束形状和网格质量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Surface + topology losses to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"直接输出可渲染、可测量的表面\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces explicit 3d anatomical triangle mesh (vertices v, faces f) and auxiliary voxel segmentation via explicit organ mesh.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"显式器官 mesh\" data-node-name-en=\"explicit organ mesh\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_134_voxel2mesh', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">显式器官 mesh</span><span class=\"lang-en\">explicit organ mesh</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">直接输出可渲染、可测量的表面</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces explicit 3d anatomical triangle mesh (vertices v, faces f) and auxiliary voxel segmentation via explicit organ mesh.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Voxel2Mesh Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 体素特征采样驱动的逐级网格变形</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Learned Neighborhood Sampling of 3D Voxel Features Driving Progressive GCN Mesh Deformation &amp; Unpooling</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Voxel2Mesh：核心公式 · 体素特征采样驱动的逐级网格变形\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"134\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"13.542743pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.723074 -69.06084 324.248848 13.542743\" width=\"324.248848pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.161274C4.079348-.486346 3.960242-.377166 3.801436-.377166C3.712107-.377166 3.642629-.456569 3.642629-.555824C3.642629-.665003 3.801436-1.280379 3.970168-1.796501C4.267931-2.72949 4.446588-3.463972 4.446588-3.