g4-186\" y=\"-63.865774\"></use><use x=\"90.933266\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g10-56\" y=\"-55.597798\"></use><use x=\"101.987713\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g20-59\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"106.706644\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g13-27\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"112.326367\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g10-18\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"117.173526\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-185\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"120.969291\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g13-69\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"126.422834\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g4-185\" y=\"-63.865774\"></use><use x=\"129.179192\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g10-18\" y=\"-63.865774\"></use><use x=\"133.393738\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g4-186\" y=\"-63.865774\"></use><use x=\"125.841016\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g10-56\" y=\"-55.597798\"></use><use x=\"136.895463\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-186\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"140.711139\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-188\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"144.626453\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-186\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"148.442129\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g13-150\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"162.86466\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-76\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"173.602093\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g1-61\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"182.904919\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-76\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"190.566181\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-67\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"195.41709\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-104\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"199.053455\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-97\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"202.282549\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-109\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"207.940733\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-102\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"210.107999\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-101\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"213.337093\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-114\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"218.485394\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-184\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"226.905986\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g13-95\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"232.619557\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g7-76\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"240.280818\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-109\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"245.939002\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-101\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"249.168096\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-115\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"251.997187\" xlink:href=\"#m134_g17-104\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">体素分割边界台阶化且高分辨率 3D 预测内存昂贵</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Voxel segmentation followed by Marching Cubes produced staircase artifacts, topological holes, and disconnected floating islands.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">从球形初始网格出发，用体素特征引导图卷积逐级形变和加密 mesh</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Sample multi-scale 3D U-Net encoder/decoder features directly at current 3D vertex coordinates and deform the mesh coarse-to-fine via GCN blocks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">联合体素编码与显式 mesh 顶点/拓扑学习直接输出表面</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Learned neighborhood voxel sampling + adaptive edge subdivision (unpooling) + normal/Laplacian/edge-length geometric regularizers.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于心脏、肝脏等器官可解释表面重建</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Produces smooth, genus-zero topological meshes for liver, hippocampus, synaptic junctions, and cardiac chambers.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">医学 mesh 深度学习代表；固定拓扑难处理孔洞和复杂拓扑变化</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Strong explicit 3D surface baseline; fixed sphere topology cannot model organs with holes or variable branching without template modification.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">从简单球面模板出发，通过图卷积直接预测表面顶点位移。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">每一级按顶点坐标从 3D CNN 特征图采样，使体素证据驱动 mesh。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">逐级 unpool 增加网格分辨率，并以几何正则保持三角面质量。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Sample multi-scale 3D U-Net encoder/decoder features directly at current 3D vertex coordinates and deform the mesh coarse-to-fine via GCN blocks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Learned neighborhood voxel sampling + adaptive edge subdivision (unpooling) + normal/Laplacian/edge-length geometric regularizers.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Learned Neighborhood Sampling of 3D Voxel Features Driving Progressive GCN Mesh Deformation &amp; Unpooling.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可直接输出心脏、肝脏等器官的显式表面，便于形态测量和物理模拟。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">固定球形拓扑难表达孔洞或拓扑变化；边界弱、病灶突出和薄结构可能被平滑正则拉回。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Produces smooth, genus-zero topological meshes for liver, hippocampus, synaptic junctions, and cardiac chambers.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Strong explicit 3D surface baseline; fixed sphere topology cannot model organs with holes or variable branching without template modification.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-59719-1_30\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Voxel2Mesh: 3D Mesh Model Generation from Volumetric Data</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/cvlab-epfl/voxel2mesh\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
